# Large torpedo: devastating if it lands, slow and expensive. 6.0 hp makes it a
# point-defense CHECK -- standard PD needs most of a second of beam time, so it
# punishes drained capacitors and HOLD stances. Counter it early or dodge hard.
id          heavy_torpedo
name        "Heavy Torpedo"
kind        missile
size        L
icon        ic-missile
damage      120
reload      9.0
proj_speed  5000
proj_life   16
proj_radius 8.0
cap_cost    45
emission    1.0
proj_hp     6.0
price       2600
tier        2
